   theorem nabla_metricCompatible {X Y Z : VectorField}
       (hX : ContDiff ℝ ⊤ X) (hY : ContDiff ℝ ⊤ Y) (hZ : ContDiff ℝ ⊤ Z) (x : E) :
       fderiv ℝ (fun z => c.formOfField z (Y z) (Z z)) x (X x) =
         c.formOfField x (c.nabla X Y x) (Z x) + c.formOfField x (Y x) (c.nabla X Z x)
   ```
   where `formOfField x := formOf (c.chartCoefficients x)`.

   Proof plan:
