/-- The pointwise chart-coefficient datum at `x`, with the derivative data being the
actual Frechet derivatives of the coefficients in the coordinate directions. The four
hypotheses of `ChartMetricCoefficients` are discharged pointwise; `d_symm` is the
derived `dFamily_symm`. -/
def chartCoefficients (x : ChartPoint ι) : ChartMetricCoefficients ι where
  g := c.g x
  gInv := c.gInv x
  d := c.dFamily x
  g_symm := c.g_symm x
  gInv_symm := c.gInv_symm x
  inv_mul := c.inv_mul x
  d_symm := c.dFamily_symm x
```

